WEBVTT

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.860
It's so hot!

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.820
So hot.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:13.780
It's too hot to do anything at all forever!

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:19.050
Oh yeah! Maybe if I imagine how cold it is in the winter I'll feel a bit cooler.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.350
Wow! Nice and cold!

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.040
Piping hot!

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:32.240
Udon?

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:37.760
I'll warm you right up!

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.270
Why are you here, Mr. Kuma?

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:42.480
And why are you so huge?

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:47.040
It just got even hotter!

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.900
Lala!

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:50.650
Nao!

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.610
Wanna hit the pool today?

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:57.320
I'll be there!

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.920
Really? That's great.

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:03.380
You've been so busy lately, we haven't had any time to hang out.

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:05.540
I thought you might not be able to make it today either.

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:10.170
I'll be waiting at the Parajuku Pool entrance in half an hour.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:11.460
Capisce!

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.470
Nothing beats the heat better than going to the pool with friends!

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:20.000
Dad's got the gelato wagon at the poolside right now too.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.930
You sure about this, sis?

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:22.760
What?

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:26.310
Don't you have a performance today?

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:08.790
Oh no! I forgot I have a PriPara show at 2!

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:12.970
Double-booked, huh? You're a real dolt.

00:03:12.970 --> 00:03:14.670
It's Mr. Kuma.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:18.010
Oh yeah! I'll ask him if we could change the time!

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.720
Sure is hot-kuma. Aloha.

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:23.180
What's with that getup?

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:25.810
I'm tryin' to get a resort feel goin' here.

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:30.400
So, today you're up for the Exciting Summer Swimsuit Coord Live.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:34.440
Like the title implies, you'll be performing in swimsuits. You gonna be okay? Splish splash?

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.480
Yeah! I have my swimsuit all ready to go!

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.400
My, how stylish!

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.950
You an idiot? This a joke?

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.980
Don't insult PriPara, ya git!

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:45.160
Ya want me to readjust your teeth, numbskull? Huh?

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:49.980
You've got a whole new level of competition here, so get it together-kuma!

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:51.120
Y-Yes sir!

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:52.560
So, about the time of...

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:55.370
You know it starts at 2, so you better not be late-kuma!

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:59.700
If you <i>are</i> late, I'll personally pour miso soup into every glass of orange juice you ever try to drink-kuma!

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:01.860
Real good stuff, that miso-orange, uh-huh!

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:03.090
What?

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:05.010
What do I do?

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:07.310
You'll just have to cancel your trip to the pool, right?

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:11.540
What? No way can I do that, because...

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:13.270
I promised Nao!

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:16.700
And she had her PriTicket confiscated.

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:20.460
<i>Lala, did you get a PriTicket?</i>

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:26.420
I haven't even told Nao I've gone to PriPara.

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:28.280
<i>Lala!</i>

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:31.370
And she's always so nice to me.

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:35.060
I don't want to lie to her anymore.

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:40.940
All right. Today's the day I tell Nao everything!

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:44.360
I'll explain the situation to Nao and then head off to PriPara!

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:46.780
Can't decide on just one, huh?

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:48.010
Wait!

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:51.650
Don't go to the pool in your school swimsuit!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:03.900
So many Parakappas! I love these guys!

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:05.910
Dad!

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:09.990
Oh! Don't gogurt to the deep end!

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:12.010
Gotcha! Let's go!

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:12.950
Yeah!

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:23.050
Parakappa! Parakappa!

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:28.220
I'm gonna go get some lunch.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.220
Okay.

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:32.810
It's been too long since we hung out!

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:35.140
Warning ticket 120 for you.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:41.600
Paprika Academy Rule #13985:
No running on the poolside deck.

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:43.320
H-Head Disciplinarian?

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:44.340
Moreover, #22491:

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:46.610
No
jumping
in!

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:49.680
No jumping in a pool without warming up first!

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:49.850
No
jumping
in!

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:50.580
Stay
hydrated!!

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.970
And #35439:

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:55.810
Always take care to stay hydrated!!

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.260
You saw everything?

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:02.240
Don't think you're off the hook just because we're not at school.

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:06.400
But what a coincidence that you'd be here too!

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:10.430
I wanted to study the latest swimsuit trends before the show.

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:16.600
I guarantee you we'll pass when we have the most fashionable swimsuit coords around.

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:20.560
You keep your eyes peeled until the show, too.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.360
O-Okay!

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:27.030
<i>I really need to tell Nao about PriPara already.</i>

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:30.990
Wow! This is all on you?

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.990
Yeah! Come on, dig in!

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:36.200
<i>There goes all of this month's allowance and my new year's money.</i>

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:37.580
All right! Thanks!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.000
And we're not done yet!

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:43.210
Is it too hot, milady? It's your favorite, Parakappa!

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:45.960
Oh, your shoulders sure feel stiff.

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.220
How's about some music, dear customer?

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.160
And here's some sweet, sweet juice!

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:53.430
What's with the service today?

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:56.640
Uh, that's, well...

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:58.700
I've got you down pat.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:01.350
You want to copy my summer homework, don't you?

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:02.690
Huh?

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:06.130
I know the way you think.

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:10.200
But I haven't done much of it either yet.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.640
So cold!

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:14.280
Man, these fried noodles are to die for!

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:15.120
Well, that's not exactly it...

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.440
And this curry is amazing!

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:16.720
I... I...

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:18.570
This watermelon is so sweet!

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:21.120
P-P-PriPa—

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.140
PriPara?

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:23.080
What?

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:25.660
Look! PriPara TV's on!

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:31.510
I hope all you viewers are
enjoying your summer vacations too.

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:32.100
Whoa! It's Sophie! It's a rerun of that event!

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:35.220
Today's guest is Houjou Sophie.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:39.610
Summer means going to the beach, and what does going to the beach mean to you, Sophie?

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:40.720
Jellies?

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:43.030
Oh, the sea totally has those!

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:46.230
Jellyfish are apparently 98% water.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:49.920
So if you put one in the fridge, it'd get pretty cold.

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:52.420
So cool!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:59.370
Pshu...

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.490
Lady Sophie!

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:09.510
I lost sight of Lady Sophie!

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:11.360
Chanko, did you find her?

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:13.810
No I didn't find her-chanko!

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:15.470
Look harder!

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:18.310
Lady Sophie!

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:23.200
She's really popular, isn't she?

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:24.050
Yeah!

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:27.420
But I've found someone better!

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:27.900
Really?

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:30.860
And you're not gonna believe this: Her name is Lala too!

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:31.520
Huh?

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:35.320
Hello to all you viewers of PriPara TV! I'm Lala!

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.020
We're here to rejuvenate you from all the summer heat!

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:37.440
Look! That's her now!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.230
Pop, Step, Gotcha! It's Mireille!

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:44.290
How are you all dealing with the heat-pri?

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:50.760
Her idol rank is still pretty low, but her voice is amazing, and her smile is the brightest one around!

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:56.720
No matter how low I'm feeling, seeing Lala's shows always makes me smile!

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.690
I... I see!

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:04.320
And Mireille's great too. They're such a good team.

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:12.040
If only Ookanda hadn't taken my ticket, I'd be able go to PriPara to meet Lala...

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:14.560
What a shame.

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.580
So, as I was saying—

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:24.210
Hey, once we can, let's go see Lala's show together!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:27.540
Promise!

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:34.220
Please listen to our "Make It!"

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:36.880
Uh, I'll take these back, okay?

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:43.090
Gahh!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:47.550
I'm in trouble. Real big trouble.

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:52.940
It'd be really hard to say at this point,
but I don't wanna lie either... What do I do?

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:55.070
It's about time to head off to PriPara.

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:55.900
What?

00:09:57.710 --> 00:09:59.490
Oh! It really is!

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.100
I have to say it!

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:01.870
What?

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:04.070
Sorry, but you go on ahead!

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:05.200
Hey, wait!

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:08.560
Chocolate gelato, please!

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:11.590
Chocolate gelatrès bien! Coming right uppucino!

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:15.940
So, uh, Nao! Sorry, I'm sorry!

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:17.060
Hmm...

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:18.550
Wow! It's Parakappa!

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:22.510
Parakappa! If I just wear that...

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:26.770
Nao, I've been to PriPara already.

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:28.730
That Lala on TV is me.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:31.730
Hmm... You've been going without me?

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:34.150
I'm sorry.

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:37.200
Why are you making some weird joke out of it?!

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:40.370
Ahh! No way would that ever work!

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.150
Lala!

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:52.590
You like pink, right? Here you go!

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:53.540
Nao!

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:54.500
Hm?

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:58.470
Nao, I have something I need to tell you.

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:00.700
What is it?

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:04.640
I've been going to PriPara lately!

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:08.080
What are you on about?

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:10.810
You haven't gotten a PriTicket yet, right?

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:15.790
There's a good reason for all this!

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:18.710
I just never managed to tell you.

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:24.580
And I've actually got a show today too, so I have to leave soon. Sorry!

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:28.540
So that Lala is...

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:30.040
It's me!

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:34.900
But you always hated singing in front of people.

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:37.160
But I managed to do it!

00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:47.910
Liar! You said you hadn't gotten one!

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:51.020
You said you were okay with just watching idols!

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:52.000
Nao...

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:52.980
I hate you!

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:55.750
You liar! I hate you!

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:58.240
And that stupid idol Lala!

00:11:58.240 --> 00:11:59.820
And I never really liked her!

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:00.700
Nao!

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:03.530
Nao! I'm sorry!

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:06.360
Oh? Nao!

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:07.430
What's up?

00:12:07.430 --> 00:12:08.700
You came to the pool too?

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:25.650
There!

00:12:25.650 --> 00:12:26.150
Nao!

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:27.390
Here we go!

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:27.800
All right!

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:29.370
Nao!

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:31.780
That way!

00:12:31.780 --> 00:12:32.900
Gotcha!

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:58.620
Head Disciplinarian?

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:02.210
Why? Didn't you go ahead?

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:05.110
I can't afford not keeping an eye on you.

00:13:05.110 --> 00:13:08.570
But I didn't break any rules just now...

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:12.470
You didn't break the school rules, you broke idol rules!

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:13.930
Idol rules?

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:17.400
Yes. An idol must never be seen crying.

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:24.460
I heard the whole thing.

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:27.250
Huh, you were watching?

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:33.580
I think I really hurt her.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:38.250
One of your duties as an idol is to make her smile.

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:45.330
Isn't being on stage in PriPara the most important thing right now?

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:50.430
Do you really think you can make all of your fans smile if you can't even do the same for a single friend?

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:54.890
Making my friend smile from the stage...

00:13:55.390 --> 00:14:00.860
<i>No matter how low I'm feeling, seeing Lala's shows always makes me smile!</i>

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:06.530
Let's go. My swimsuit coord calculations are finished!

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:08.820
Capisce!

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:14.950
Welcome to Prism Stone. Please insert your My Ticket.

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:33.250
PriPara Change complete!

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:40.060
Scan the appropriate amount of tickets for your coord.

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:42.560
You may also scan Friend Tickets from friends.

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:48.900
Coord Change Start!

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:53.410
The Hibiscus Summer Coord.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:58.080
The colorful hibiscus of midsummer is the best match for this refreshing marine look!

00:14:58.530 --> 00:15:00.160
Hibiscus Summer!

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:06.630
And then there's the Deep Red Hibiscus Coord.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:10.090
Put on a hot show to make us forget the summer heat.

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:12.430
Hibiscus Summer! Pri!

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:19.600
What's up, Nao?

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:25.070
Hey! Look, it's a live PriPara show!

00:15:26.630 --> 00:15:28.030
Hello everyone!

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:31.490
Welcome to the Exciting Summer Swimsuit Coord Live!

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:33.700
I... I've gotta go.

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:39.410
I have something important to tell someone before our show today.

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:47.370
What's going on?

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:48.760
Chanko...

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:53.330
One important word: Sorry.

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:57.060
I'm really, really sorry!

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:02.130
It's summer and I was standing around there in a swimsuit, but I still got a bit teary-eyed.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.480
That's when I understood.

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:11.610
The reason I could always keep on smiling was because you were always there, always my friend.

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:21.330
And that was always the reason I could be here in PriPara, chasing the dream of being an idol.

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:25.510
That's why I could, in turn, make all my supporters smile.

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:31.640
It's always been your smile that let me smile.

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:37.710
I'm waiting to see you smile again.

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:42.850
So please smile.

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:44.440
Smile-pri pri!

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:48.190
I'll sing my heart out, just like that first time I sang in PriPara.

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:51.650
So that everyone will hear me!

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:18.140
<i>Nao said hearing my singing makes her feel better!</i>

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:25.500
<i>I want to sing so Nao can smile! So everyone can smile!</i>

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:53.170
Wowzers, that's great! Lala's really working that Prism Voice of hers today-kuma!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:03.120
Making Drama Switch On!

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:28.080
Fresh Sweet Park!

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:36.240
<i>Lala really tried to tell me before lots of times.</i>

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:41.740
<i>And she really wanted to apologize, but I didn't listen at all...</i>

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:46.160
<i>And it's not Lala's fault.</i>

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:50.440
<i>The headmistress is the one who took my ticket away.</i>

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:56.690
<i>I was just jealous of her...</i>

00:18:57.200 --> 00:19:00.670
<i>I got mad at her because I was jealous.</i>

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:04.280
Cyalume Change!

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:32.370
<i>Lala! I understand what you wanted to tell me!</i>

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:35.150
<i>I'm smiling!</i>

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:37.080
That was really good.

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:40.610
Hey, Nao, did you know that girl's name is Lala?

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:43.430
Huh? Nao?

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:48.160
Yahoo! Your swimsuit coord was perfect-kuma!

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:51.900
I'm downright unusually on board today-kuma!

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:54.100
That was summer good work out there! That was a joke! Get it? Hey?

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.960
Come on, let's go already!

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.970
Lala!

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:06.430
Nao... Nao!

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:12.850
Sorry. I went too far earlier.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:15.560
I'm sorry too.

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:18.550
You put on a really great show!

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:20.770
I'm so glad you're finally able to sing!

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:23.070
I knew your voice is really great!

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:24.530
And not just your voice!

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:29.800
Your smile! How nice you always are! How you care about your friends!

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:31.360
I love it all!

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:33.130
Nao...

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:37.390
So, I wanted to give you this.

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:41.230
Here.

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:45.130
What? No, I can't take that!

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:49.680
You know I don't have any tickets to trade!

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.560
I still want you to have this.

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:59.990
Just you wait, Nao. I'll become so popular the headmistress won't be able to stop me!

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:03.490
We'll get your PriTicket back for sure!

00:21:04.060 --> 00:21:07.450
And then we'll go to PriPara together!

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:08.950
Promise?

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:12.120
Yeah!

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:14.030
Promise!

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:22.170
Lady Sophie!

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:25.270
Where are you?

00:21:25.270 --> 00:21:27.160
Chanko!

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:29.300
Lady Sophie!

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:30.450
Pshu...

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:35.020
Lady Sophie!

00:23:06.240 --> 00:23:08.820
We're gonna appear on PriPara TV with Sophie?

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:10.570
We'll have to go all out!

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:12.910
Go all out? I've never tried that.

00:23:13.230 --> 00:23:15.660
Also, pshu...

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:17.070
What?

00:23:17.070 --> 00:23:20.000
Next time: The Exciting Idol Meeting!
